WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:01.918
Why are you here?

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:05.672
I wanted you to tell me.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:11.386
You slew the dragon single-handedly.
I want to be strong like you.

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:15.932
How can I stop being a coward?

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:17.892
"Stop being a coward"?

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:21.271
Who said that you are a coward?

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.024
-What?
-Who said that?

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.777
The village mayor.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:31.239
Live your life the way you want to,

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.702
not by someone else's ways.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:44.502
I believe strength is the power
to carry this through.

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:53.094
Great. That's so cool, Uncle.

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:56.347
Mabel being like this!

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:02.437
Like this, Uncle must have gradually built
relationships in the other world.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.523
How have you spent your life until now?

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:13.490
I have been a recluse
and closed off my heart.

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:16.951
That's fine.

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:19.329
What? But…

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.456
That's completely fine.

00:01:21.539 --> 00:01:25.043
No matter what people said,
I never gave up being a SEGA user

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:26.795
and never will.

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:32.759
Is your role to be an ordinary citizen
who buys a popular console?

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.053
Or…

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:41.392
Are you sure?

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:43.645
Yes, I'm sure.

00:01:52.237 --> 00:01:53.238
Incredible!

00:01:53.321 --> 00:01:57.325
-She chose her life and went back home.
-I'm so happy to stay reclusive.

00:01:57.408 --> 00:01:59.452
Oh, she gave me the sword.

00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:03.164
-Please keep the god freezing sword.
-Thanks, but no thanks. It's cold.

00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:05.083
Really?

00:02:05.166 --> 00:02:06.793
No, I declined the offer.

00:02:07.377 --> 00:02:09.170
Well… that's about it.

00:02:11.756 --> 00:02:14.884
Uncle, would you care for
a bowl of soba noodles?

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.595
That's a good idea. Let's boil the water.

